sure — since the setup is after aiyetoro town season 2, i’d keep the joke quick and domestic, not like you’re performing a review of the show. make her feel seen, then land the teasing gently.

try this:

“my dear, after tonight’s episode, i’m convinced our house is still peaceful compared with that compound o. small noise there becomes full community meeting in five seconds. but watching it with you is the sweet part for me. you laugh, i laugh, and the evening settles properly. may god keep our home warm, calm, and full of better jokes than those people’s wahala 🙏❤️”

if you want it a little sharper:

“see, after this season 2 episode, i respect our home more. those compound people can turn one small matter into a national conference. but you beside me laughing is the part i’ll keep. correct wife, correct evening”

i’d send the first one if she likes warmth and the second if she enjoys your blunt teasing. don’t explain the joke too much. one clean message is stronger than three extra lines
